<title>PHILIPPINES: Pryce sets date for stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Pryce sets date for stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pryce Properties Corp said on Monday the record date for its 15 percent stock dividend has been set for April 10, 1997.</p>
<p>Pryce said in a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange that both the dividend and record date were approved by stockholders in a meeting last Friday.</p>
<p>In 1996, the property concern did not pay a dividend. In 1995, its payout was 0.04 pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
